-STATEMENT MATCH (a:person) OPTIONAL MATCH (a)-[:knows]->(b:person)-[:knows]->(c:person) RETURN COUNT(*)
---- 1
40

-LOG OptionalColExtendTest
-STATEMENT MATCH (a:person) OPTIONAL MATCH (a)-[:workAt]->(b:organisation) RETURN COUNT(*)
---- 1
