-LOG MultipleOptionalCountTest
-STATEMENT MATCH (a:person) OPTIONAL MATCH (a)-[:knows]->(b:person) OPTIONAL MATCH (b)-[:knows]->(c:person) RETURN COUNT(*)
---- 1
41

-LOG MatchDropsNullFromLeftJoin
-STATEMENT MATCH (a:person) OPTIONAL MATCH (a)-[:studyAt]->(b:organisation) WITH a, b MATCH (b) RETURN a.ID, b.ID
